# play logs/read-pager-none ------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Logs screen proposed for slice 1, read$
# from a simulated host by the gallery's stand-ins, unit (b)'s$
# to build. It only reads: no plan, no y/N, no journal. No pager$
# runs: an item says what it would run. Nothing on this machine$
# changes: every command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: logs/read-pager-none$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13 with no less: treatment$
# read-pager falls back to read-tail's screen, P-18's "otherwise$
# the last N lines".$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
# Log ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  File                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Size                 410 bytes, 8 lines$
$
# Last 6 of 8 lines --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:01 INFO: run 1: $ ufw allow 2230/tcp$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:01 INFO: run 1: | Rule added$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:01 INFO: run 1: exit 0$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:03 INSTALLED: Package ufw$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:04 WARNING: ufw is not active$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:05 ERROR: Failed to configure firewall:$
      exit status 1$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

